    "lyrics": {
      "text": "Grant rest__ with the right-eous un-to Thy ser-vants, O our Sav-iour, and make them to dwell in Thy courts, as it is writ-ten. And since Thou art good, o-ver-look__ their of-fenc-es, wheth-er vol-un-tar-y or in-vol-un-tar-y, and all things com-mit-ted ei-ther in knowl--edge or ig-no-rance, O Friend of__ man. \n\nAnd all things com-mit-ted ei-ther in knowl--edge or ig-no-rance, O Friend of__ man. \n\nO_ Thou__ Who didst dawn forth up-on the world from a Vir-gin, and through her hast made us sons of light, O Christ__ God, have mer-cy on us."
    }
  }
